
1. Test backtrack over variables.

Example x1...x8

Bind pairwise

     x1=x2
        x3=x4
            x5=x6
                x7=x8
                    x2=x4
                        x6=x8
                            x4=x8
			    x4!=x8
			x6!=x8

2. Test multiple backtrack & run them in parallell

   Create N instances of the problem, all with different
   settings and variable order etc.

   Now multitask over the instances.
